el optimization, social copy, and daily formatting calculations.</p></div><div class=\"card flex flex-col gap-4\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.5rem;padding:1.5rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1rem\"><div class=\"form-group\" style=\"margin-bottom:0;width:100%\"><label for=\"tools-search\" class=\"sr-only\">Search tools</label><input id=\"tools-search\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search tools by name or description...\" class=\"form-control\" aria-label=\"Search tools by name or description\" value=\"\"/></div><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Filter tools by category\" style=\"display:flex;gap:0.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color);padding-bottom:0.75rem\"><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"tools-panel\" id=\"tab-all\" class=\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\">All Tools (<!-- -->33<!-- -->)</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tools-panel\" id=\"tab-image\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Image Tools<!-- --> (<!-- -->10<!-- -->)</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tools-panel\" id=\"tab-creator\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Creator Tools<!-- --> (<!-- -->7<!-- -->)</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tools-panel\" id=\"tab-social\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Social Media Tools<!-- --> (<!-- -->8<!-- -->)</button><button role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tools-panel\" id=\"tab-utility\" class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-sm\">Utility Tools<!-- --> (<!-- -->8<!-- -->)</button></div></div></div><div id=\"tools-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-all\"><div class=\"grid-cols-3\"><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Image Compressor - Compress PNG, JPG, and WebP images directly in your browser without losing quality.\" href=\"/tools/image/image-compressor\"><div class=\"flex justify-between ite