 gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open PNG to WebP Converter - Convert PNG graphics to modern WebP format to reduce web loading times.\" href=\"/tools/image/png-to-webp-converter\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.65rem\">Image Tools</span></div><h3 style=\"font-size:1.2rem;margin:0\">PNG to WebP Converter</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Convert PNG graphics to modern WebP format to reduce web loading times.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open WebP to JPG Converter - Convert next-gen WebP images back into widely compatible JPG files.\" href=\"/tools/image/webp-to-jpg-converter\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.65rem\">Image Tools</span></div><h3 style=\"font-size:1.2rem;margin:0\">WebP to JPG Converter</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Convert next-gen WebP images back into widely compatible JPG files.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Image Cropper - Crop images to specific ratios like 16:9, 1:1, 4:3, or custom shapes instantly.\" href=\"/tools/image/image-cropper\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.65rem\">Image Tools</span></div><h3 style=\"font-size:1.2rem;margin:0\">Image Cropper</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Crop images to specific ratios like 16:9, 1:1, 4:3, or custom shapes instantly.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Image Rotator - Rotate your images 90°, 180°, or 270° clockwise or counter-clockwise.\" href=\"/tools/image/image-rotator\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.65rem\">Image Tools</span></div><h3 style=\"font-size:1.2rem;margin:0\">Image Rotator</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Rotate your images 90°, 180°, or 270° clockwise or counter-clockwise.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Image Flipper - Mirror images horizontally or vertically to correct mirroring issues.\" href=\"/tools/image/image-flipper\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.65rem\">Image Tools</span></div><h3 style=\"font-size:1.2rem;margin:0\">Image Flipper</h3><p class=\"text-muted\" style=\"font-size:0.875rem;margin:0;flex-grow:1;line-height:1.4\">Mirror images horizontally or vertically to correct mirroring issues.</p><span class=\"text-primary-color\" style=\"font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600;margin-top:0.5rem\">Open Tool →</span></a><a class=\"card card-hover flex flex-col gap-3\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:inherit\" aria-label=\"Open Color Picker &amp; Extractor - Extract colors from images or use the visual palette builder to get HEX/RGB codes.\" href=\"/tools/image/color-picker\"><div class=\"flex justify-between items-start\"><span class=\"badge badge-accent\" style=\"font-size:0.65rem\">Image Tools</span></div><h3 style=\"font-si